{"D:\\wt\\lou9\\vlog\\lou9\\voz\\b009_t3.wav": {"text": "Some drivers wanted it over a split hot dog, some over spaghetti, some on top of a pile of french fries, and the farmers wanted a square of cornbread under it. Seventy-five cents a bowl in 1975, a dollar fifty in the eighties. Refills on the crackers were always free. Now you can't have truck stop chili without the cornbread. Here's the one from my diner. 1 cup of yellow cornmeal, 1 cup of flour, 1 quarter cup of sugar, 1 tablespoon of baking powder, 1 teaspoon of salt, then 1 cup of buttermilk, 1 egg, and a third of a cup of melted bacon grease or butter. Stir it just until it's wet. Here's the trick. Put your cast iron skillet in the oven while it heats up to 425 with a spoon of bacon grease in it. When the batter hits that hot skillet, it sizzles, and that's what gives you the crunchy brown edge. Twenty minutes.", "words": [{"w": " Some", "s": 0.02, "e": 0.3}, {"w": " drivers", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.84}, {"w": " wanted", "s": 0.84, "e": 1.28}, {"w": " it", "s": 1.28, "e": 1.54}, {"w": " over", "s": 1.54, "e": 1.84}, {"w": " a", "s": 1.84, "e": 2.04}, {"w": " split", "s": 2.04, "e": 2.42}, {"w": " hot", "s": 2.42, "e": 2.88}, {"w": " dog,", "s": 2.88, "e": 3.82}, {"w": " some", "s": 3.82, "e": 3.96}, {"w": " over", "s": 3.96, "e": 4.32}, {"w": " spaghetti,", "s": 4.32, "e": 5.62}, {"w": " some", "s": 5.62, "e": 5.7}, {"w": " on", "s": 5.7, "e": 6.06}, {"w": " top", "s": 6.06, "e": 6.34}, {"w": " of", "s": 6.34, "e": 6.52}, {"w": " a", "s": 6.52, "e": 6.62}, {"w": " pile", "s": 6.62, "e": 6.9}, {"w": " of", "s": 6.9, "e": 7.1}, {"w": " french", "s": 7.1, "e": 7.42}, {"w": " fries,", "s": 7.42, "e": 8.3}, {"w": " and", "s": 8.3, "e": 8.48}, {"w": " the", "s": 8.48, "e": 8.62}, {"w": " farmers", "s": 8.62, "e": 9.08}, {"w": " wanted", "s": 9.08, "e": 9.48}, {"w": " a", "s": 9.48, "e": 9.78}, {"w": " square", "s": 9.78, "e": 10.12}, {"w": " of", "s": 10.12, "e": 10.34}, {"w": " cornbread", "s": 10.34, "e": 10.88}, {"